The way I've done it in the current version is that where previously,
only the child monster lost half its maxHP after cloning, now both the
parent _and_ child lose half their maxHP.  This provides enough
splittage to cause problems for careless players while still providing a
relatively rapid end to the parade of puddings.

It works relatively well so far.  It'll be more interesting to see how
it fares after the general population gets hold of it, since I'm sure
some clever soul will go digging for ways to break things.  :)

